01:13:26.220 --> 01:13:28.240
Nobel prizes for cognitive function.

1898
01:13:28.500 --> 01:13:30.380
No college degree for working class.

1899
01:13:30.600 --> 01:13:32.260
Self-reported turnout for turnout.

1900
01:13:32.540 --> 01:13:33.200
On reliability,

1901
01:13:33.940 --> 01:13:36.780
ask whether repeating the procedure would give the same answer.

1902
01:13:36.960 --> 01:13:39.300
Then say which direction the error runs,

1903
01:13:39.420 --> 01:13:42.480
because systematic error is far worse than random noise.

